                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Simply open Multi Run, select the app you want to clone, and follow the on-screen instructions.Separate workspaces for professional/personal use. Auto-schedule switches (e.g., mute work apps after hours) and hide sensitive apps in Stealth Mode.",
